# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only scratch / handoff material — never committed.
#
# Convention: Claude scratch notes, design drafts, bench captures, mockups,
# and handoff docs live at the repo ROOT. Real docs and assets live under
# subdirectories (components/, docs/, products/**/docs|specs|assets|web) and
# stay tracked, so the root-scoped rules below never touch them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Conversation / engineering handoff documents (any case, root or nested).
HANDOFF.md
HANDOFF_*.md
[Hh]andoff*.md

# Serial logs and bench captures, anywhere in the tree.
*.log

# Merged / flashable firmware images dropped outside build/.
*-merged.bin

# Root-level scratch HTML — mockups, plots, screen sims.
# (Keeps real assets like components/.../portal.html and
#  products/reference/main/web/index.html, which live in subdirectories.)
/*.html

# Root-level scratch Markdown — everything at the root EXCEPT the project's
# own top-level docs. Drop any throwaway .md note at the repo root and it is
# ignored automatically; nested docs/ and specs/ are unaffected.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md

# Internal review / handoff write-ups kept for local reference only.
docs/internal/
